<BaseLayout title="Contact | Arizona Paycheck Calculator" description="Contact Arizona Paycheck Calculator with corrections, accessibility feedback, content questions or suggestions." path="/contact/" crumbs={[{name:'Contact',href:'/contact/'}]}>
<article class="prose legal"><h1>Contact</h1><p>We welcome feedback that helps make the calculator and educational resources clearer, more accurate and easier to use. You can contact the site about a possible calculation issue, an outdated tax reference, a broken page, accessibility concern or a general content suggestion.</p><h2>What to include in a correction report</h2><ul><li>The page URL and tax year you were reviewing.</li><li>The input assumptions used, without including Social Security numbers, account details or other sensitive personal information.</li><li>The result or statement you believe may be incorrect.</li><li>A link to an official government source, if available.</li></ul><h2>Contact details</h2><p>A public contact email has not yet been configured for this site. Before launch, the site owner should add a monitored email address in the site configuration. Do not send confidential tax records or identity documents.</p><h2>Personal tax questions</h2><p>We cannot provide individualized tax, legal or payroll advice. For questions about a specific paycheck, contact your employer’s payroll department or a qualified tax professional.</p></article>
</BaseLayout>
